# Wendi's Level 1: Three-Step Tumble
# Roll one ball down the entry slide to Button 1. It releases the trap door,
# dropping a second ball onto Button 2 and revealing the tower ladder. Roll the
# upper ball from its ledge onto Button 3 to open the exit.
script button_sequence
bounds 0 0 1600 900
playerStart 72 168

# Chamber shell and entry ledge.
solid 0 0 1600 28
solid 0 28 28 872
solid 1572 28 28 872
solid 28 220 230 32
boulder 215 184 26 2.2

# Wendi's long ramp/slide and Button 1 landing.
ramp 390 374 380 32 35
solid 530 510 210 40
button 625 494 82 16
# This short stop catches the first ball after it rolls across Button 1.
solid 715 474 14 36

# The chain visually carries Button 1's pull to the trap-door latch.
chain 666 474 840 405 20 0.70 1 1

# The waiting ball falls from this door onto Button 2.
trapDoor 840 405 220 26 0
boulder 970 367 26 2.6
solid 530 760 1042 60
button 1010 744 92 16

# Button 2 reveals the tall ladder beside the trap door.
buttonLadder 1 1110 142 52 618

# Upper ledge and third ball. Its left edge begins after the ladder shaft,
# leaving a real opening for the player to climb through.
solid 1162 142 278 32
boulder 1320 105 26 2.4
solid 1415 760 157 60
solid 1390 700 25 120
button 1460 744 82 16

# The exit is immediately left of Button 3's catch basin.
exit 1270 540 110 220

# Latched cause-and-effect links from Wendi's sketch.
buttonTrapDoor 0 0 78 115
buttonExit 2
